{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a686a6230dbc40c2197afe5bb6149008db4826e0636f986d21d5bd0b03eb8f28",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db6eaf0a12efcd4ee3f52a00e144cc52d499ec97bbcad0e816fbdfeba70c0591",
      "text": "正义的英雄",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cb1e61dbe0e726b9b996598ec88722bd30d7b9afdd9b66c293a12cbb1c7981a",
      "text": "自幼时起便憧憬着正义英雄的辉。\n经过坚持不懈的努力，终于进入了著名的律师事务所。\n然而，因为某起事件，\n他不得不离开了事务所……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000008:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000008:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db6eaf0a12efcd4ee3f52a00e144cc52d499ec97bbcad0e816fbdfeba70c0591",
      "text": "正义的英雄",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e80be43de556feae9fe517bd77d93b0eef42868b5fc098a3e24676a60adf8ffd",
      "text": "喂，你们在干什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c7ce9000d00b404997b81bb4315a8489028b5aa74f86db92d60125e73dda5e3",
      "text": "不准以强凌弱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:478536e5e65d7e1be21ea42150e5b7dfb739b0d6c193e90f7687cf2df9827cbc",
      "text": "干嘛啊，别来碍事！\n你也是这家伙的同伙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:964c597d96d263e117a4a7c4ff0a782a54725bc2bf88a66e3958cb6d3c9c1b71",
      "text": "那些都无所谓！英雄就是弱者的伙伴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a18fd4def91b0e39213a7600383f75bd720432a98c155ebee12089bc10df02",
      "text": "看我打倒你们，做好觉悟吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:816c4af3662f2fc72bef212f653a51600059b0de6e20146b40fa248cf712b3fa",
      "text": "可恶——！给我记着！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a64f9cec49bfb290b18e15baa86d6ba1a1130e8cf0e5cd9f137856e87193d73",
      "text": "你们才是，别再让我看到\n你们欺负别人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d441c04527f3dc01c8e401e091471485caa5114ad89d8d51784723dbdff0e2e4",
      "text": "……那个，你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c7095c7b4c0f1ee81f4cc8abc8a26b4b962970ecc879171f4521f81121a5e18",
      "text": "嗯、嗯，谢谢你！你是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dd4d4f5faaccb324ca95b6047142d78252b3c5931345b28c29cbbc12821de59",
      "text": "我的名字是，天道辉！\n是正义的伙伴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000009:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ded5eceefabdd0506c7cdfaf7cd54da2a6d7c037d3ef03f987d4c26fa0462e5",
      "text": "辉，你跑到哪里去了！\n一下子就不见人影。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e47062fe59d9f100f93f91fa6f25c60ab397954474a990b55fd155361dee96f7",
      "text": "嘿嘿。因为看到有人被欺负，\n我就跑去见义勇为了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7495d4528f4fd8817284c45284b3a794040bdee501daf350447acea30f1d2e4",
      "text": "见义勇为……你又跟人打架了吧？\n妈妈之前不是说过不行的吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86cbfa09ecd68e0ff9f623f41ed5405a914ff14ad4e63cf8e0d1338f33a3b0b7",
      "text": "不、不是的，妈妈！不是打架，\n我是在作为英雄战斗啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:991c23cf45cc3663fbfc3fba8b832820f258180cf429752289ffe18c04885ba9",
      "text": "英雄是“正义的伙伴”对吧？\n所以，绝不能对弱小的人见死不救！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60701639ccb8b49957f7958cdda345b5a651c265209bfa58af5701342efa66ef",
      "text": "真是的，你每次都是这副德行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36207aacc0b47f24a3a76c44004a4c61a2512668bd43203b2c46b0287a46e212",
      "text": "呵呵，精神饱满不是挺好的嘛。\n男孩子就该这样嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fedb0bd8bb62bfd2b2a817e6184614ba38ba9595c2b891ca0be843b4743b11",
      "text": "不过，辉君？可不能让妈妈担心哦。\n英雄扮演游戏也要适可而止呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7519a5212017fafb9a167347c16fcd04e66c3d265b23274a277561c6c1a9331",
      "text": "所——以——说——，不是啦！\n才不是过家家呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fdf07554a157c38acaf4f929ff3151dbebfe63180feb778782ff8cf45d7c656",
      "text": "我可是要成为，真正的英雄的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa727ac5abf7fb2d8bd7ec6c6a28ae73aeaac7bd687432e97e9c0b41005cb83e",
      "text": "从小我就喜欢大家的笑容。\n只要有人遇到困难，我就无法坐视不管。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6a670d117648ee22cf5129dd56cf045dee0dc29478dd850506036e517b6786",
      "text": "无论面对的是什么样的人，\n只要需要帮助，我就会伸出援手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316c934be4946638d13449bcfdea8864a7adcae6f2502fa063fcab7fb3daf8c0",
      "text": "虽然也曾因为这个原因被责骂过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2e4922fdb090282050d998e10108fbe3cdde7f74a361b11357b03f844013de5",
      "text": "但这就是我的本性，也没办法嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77474d2c27ae7b9331746913a881bb5f00319b368a596a93bfa677c50935b913",
      "text": "也许会让人觉得有点烦人……不过你看，\n连同这种热情在内，不是很适合当英雄吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b5be79c0108db7dec07cfad6bcdc541f508ac1870875d53793890709ffb8f07",
      "text": "喂，天道！\n数学作业是今天交吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f4b34185ff7b3414d483bdfc86a469a416f8da95573593217a861d3a0380b87",
      "text": "嗯？啊啊，是啊。\n……难不成，你小子没写？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca41f4c331463173716c3f53bd04a00702873963842363d3f054488d469d11f9",
      "text": "就是这样啊！我完全给忘了……\n求求你了天道，借我抄一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd05b96a230eb6dcb3abac2f4c8ff724adf5d5dcfbdfc84493d411d8e7101eb0",
      "text": "唔——，借你倒是无所谓，\n但全盘照抄对你也没好处啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4338f39a5f0e7717c23bab3039927df0df754f16feac97290835aaaba2bad70",
      "text": "有了，我想到了一个好主意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f6b06a292d42beea1d271992fef2f068c24ddd04dc4b286bd25dd46e6ba9549",
      "text": "作业你完全没动笔对吧？\n既然这样，我来教你解题方法吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e62ec967d5e82cd165f0fc87621a5aee9899803818071585251e7e941254d9b3",
      "text": "反正午休还有时间嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c2a586ad810239e4dceb95f9347cd1919c095d25ddf6996a5cf44ab88a2187e",
      "text": "真的吗！帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e03f4fdff5ba580d03902b35f32760091bec0a725c5eeb6e53a4bd8d7afb7e8",
      "text": "咦，天道要教大家功课吗？\n那我也能拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcb21aaf4d9687661004c87966360e6f40ad41fdcecc1998b257faab082ae247",
      "text": "啊，还有我！\n这道题我怎么都搞不懂正发愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b1f9b28c0eeee3d8a7de227ed52f60b3c6ecc5edd7a621a489577d3add658dc",
      "text": "好——嘞，那大家聚过来，\n我一口气全教了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b0c1a9205d4b41f269484b8932714f8019705ca34f54539a20dadbb1f03a73",
      "text": "天道真厉害啊。学习这么好。\n将来想做什么，已经决定好了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75fa6a547704b83f09dbcd5329cba5166a3e2ee19a1975374e8946223314b642",
      "text": "诶？这个嘛，虽然很难说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94e3dbf02664224621614523bbf3cfc9a0949dd01e2ec055ea37656832561d95",
      "text": "……想为别人派上用场。\n这种想法，我一直都有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f4dab694964b1a9fde4bca628ed854cf76c3bec10037d3b285be592cec54a1a",
      "text": "所以……想成为帮助大家的正义伙伴！\n大概是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458",
      "text": "数年后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7babb18749a26ba8b5a40ed299eaf8d4122a637beda964e9340a9662530dc792",
      "text": "（差不多快到最终面试结果公布的时间了……\n哇，开始紧张起来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7bfbdade5ac238a1176cbcbbb2f70ef84ee150034c6d67935b3e471e1d236c1",
      "text": "（不不不，没事的。我都那么拼命学了，\n连司法考试都通过了。这次也一定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f92972942f46c1626b51cd75131e93872f38dde6ad7bbb59067b0100923986",
      "text": "……来了！\n您好，我是天道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c43a5f1731f955036e5443b7b432856b2c74ba9bbbcf74a2d53452e2c6653b0",
      "text": "是的……合、合格了！？\n真的吗，非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18e4839ac0b05541c23629bb3714f840fd0ac760db06c8f8984559f7dea232b9",
      "text": "好的，今后我会努力的。\n请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3b3f2e100afc8c76c3c1028cb16a88d10ef3231cbb06d1eb6f20d57191e564f",
      "text": "好的……好的，失礼了！\n……呼～～……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20a7be2aead93e507338c6d4e9047e99b985fcf774b626c651adc4e5a6c211ba",
      "text": "（我真的，考上律师事务所了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d4e2ef9a87d8d2be62a2b545ba7ac62cad655b1102adef62ded0e80053cbed3",
      "text": "（这样终于能够作为律师工作了。\n能够让更多的人展露笑容了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc56001e6979d62d347ca123a96c2976cca3e978f9a1fa5b58125ed9b83e7e51",
      "text": "（我的梦想，梦想实现了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e63cd485c21ebbb3e7c2aa858056402c3cd8b558a150a58a1d096d0d3c9b95",
      "text": "那时的我，总之就是满腔热血全神贯注。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f3d35a2f3210528df7911f190b9be326cd3a37d999701edb42dd5a28904532",
      "text": "为了能多救一个人，\n每天都在各处东奔西走。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1250c90ecbf0ae6c0c84138384c4c2771861b8db3df86599cb35dff3c4178e6e",
      "text": "每次看到大家的笑容，就觉得选择这份工作\n果然没有错，胸口一阵阵发热。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a77f45a9dcd3e5e3ba239f030c78253fa7e478f45ea6cb5cba0341d52e5a34",
      "text": "我会就这样一路狂奔，成为憧憬的英雄。\n我曾如此坚信着。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e38c69d8bab6ba16e4251f628d68eed260e56a23475a5cb3a697a86507449d",
      "text": "以某个案件为契机，我离开了律师事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23cfbdbc87049aa1f9a7eb4f4279a2461a73c3f473852ddd6da829df2c663457",
      "text": "……今天也是没有来电。\n邮件咨询也是零吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19e23680fbf3bdd61caf89f81d0816382c171fab802839c6191a3ebdfab76f6",
      "text": "（离开事务所之后，\n开始以独立身份活动是不错，但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cfd7aeb4fad8399b73be0558333f90799d7657b5ed31b4a4ac1801d0b3c396",
      "text": "完——全接不到工作啊！\n真没想到，竟然会被人冷落到这种地步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91235b39e3b798d23419264a667c3c41bdb8dffb441ea4ce0fcb5102c915449b",
      "text": "（离开事务所这件事，我并不后悔。\n但是……这种状态下，根本谈不上救人啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dfa9909c4db211cabd3087fa5268508d1390fe74d36f1499c00341ead142552",
      "text": "……成为英雄的梦想，也就到此为止了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94b277c626decc860c5ac66c2e7b5d7908cf48f326e47abb96d063ce16d199ff",
      "text": "虽然早就心里有数，\n但独立律师果然很艰难啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d152c96a623e7c2be20ff151bbfa7da1cf3e4779f74e1b69b2cc4ef27d63430c",
      "text": "既没有什么门路，\n单靠个人能做的宣传也十分有限。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c81c35878e2b85d2ec2ebf3c8a66b0c204f8e5d8f8a161d407a9c5d9ece42b0",
      "text": "虽说像个傻瓜一样一路狂奔，心想着\n“要成为让大家展露笑容的正义英雄！”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bb13ac680c11ebef272e14d4bcdaa981e1aadb680269bae6677457ff76cbef",
      "text": "但对于我来说，或许还是太勉强了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4917bc23afb92097e449f3445598e91b67dc7ccb79770bd737b6f2191eabc172",
      "text": "……那个，打扰一下。\n我可以坐在旁边吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd78ad6ab7c4cfb9b447d624ecb4a78ac4548a24d387d225063026ea68c43233",
      "text": "诶？啊啊，请坐。\n反正也没人坐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2da0ee371b95cf5e5cc7e2a3fe9992ec1a83f83af873fcf4015a8d3bfc3391a",
      "text": "非常感谢。其实，我从刚才起就有点在意\n表情一直很严肃的您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b08c85753257d88a5b80c8fd2cf711243241ffa05ee6dc81fab25df19c11623d",
      "text": "于是忍不住过来搭话了。\n如果打扰到您的话，真是非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21d379164893d706454d92608b58e9d749ba75358fcbe5a390bcc6ea5c1cc039",
      "text": "啊——让您担心了不好意思啊。\n谈不上打扰什么的，没事的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecd898ffa2f32cfd133e5b4bc62f8ac1d0e28b473d89fc2dcfd6b74c792730a1",
      "text": "太好了。……如果可以的话，能稍微聊聊吗？\n若是有什么烦恼，请跟我讲讲吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a3f46ae8b153b8a74eb27a5c10b99f738c48956e6703ca1a8f6725d79c3a87",
      "text": "……然后呢，就和事务所的老板大吵了一架。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:924eeeed4f0da5c1ecaaea5b46acb150de19b5bbb2061a3eceae3d191efb7e2f",
      "text": "与其说是顺势辞职，\n不如说是几乎直接摔门跑出来的感觉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a0902f14f3bf80048a10f3eca84ebb5f81c43c7e1022f58b4469c17e051b924",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n所以，现在是以自由执业者的身份在工作吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:116dc5c2067fe09e7e39de58bf3e196e1fdbafad5413c0596906911247e3b931",
      "text": "啊啊。……不对，根本算不上在工作吧。\n今天也是连一单委托都没接到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018736bf67e89f2522a45808f1b94a3cd72ba209ec0164ed258da13a58716de2",
      "text": "完全不顺利啊……\n这种事情，光靠干劲也是没办法的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:731723888f8905640e734063ae2882e5f82e9c272c3325791bd7edaa66304a18",
      "text": "不好意思，我可以问您一个问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a8be0aafdb3766b399141ba49054d927193481a25ee2da6b0c5a3a583ddd863",
      "text": "辉先生，刚才说过对吧。\n“想要成为正义的英雄”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17863561694756878f925b285baf6490caf218d3c249aa0a929df7571ebfaf73",
      "text": "放弃那个梦想……您没有考虑过这种选项吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44d55d118a3e6866d4a27b60ce3219b3d7f5ecf068304d65b700a95b1855f202",
      "text": "那个嘛……没有吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51ec3fddd5f2fb78dca2863ef4f2132165eaeac426a140d0f376f7268ba1a367",
      "text": "跑出事务所的时候，我就发过誓了。\n无论多么痛苦，都要堂堂正正、坦率正直地活下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:402298ebb673a013be85e4f0c02d82ac5e1d20376792a93e45168e582c6b5a48",
      "text": "事务所辞掉了，也没工作。\n现在也只是坐在这里发牢骚而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c601caec7c826976b7704f02fc11eef79ffb9e48ffa478b70526e2af5a6ee410",
      "text": "但想让别人展露笑容的心情是没有变的。\n想必今后也一直都不会变。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2511229021652ab409bbe4786fbc09d36026c4e10533bcb272a385656f96147d",
      "text": "所以我无论发生什么，\n都不会从自己的梦想中逃避的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78248f6491e25ee4dafb560e4cdd95be90b576c195c6a1fecc9ab2fdcc39c5c3",
      "text": "哎呀……光有气势可就太逊了。\n嘿嘿，明天开始也得继续加油才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625193e0662d1b0d3052dcc231f3f6972754f06ab6b186d3aa1e156991c0b5f8",
      "text": "（辉先生，是真的发自内心地\n想要让大家展露笑容啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ca9dcc29b917d96d7980db8707d72ca5858af63d7b9e4887a2a6bfaebbcc6e0",
      "text": "辉先生。关于那个梦想，能否也让我\n助您一臂之力呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e81347583b78bc7dc1eb5dd3bf4bcbcc66742cf56673131f955a82d51cffa00",
      "text": "嗯？帮忙，是指……\n这是，名片？315 Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe631da2db9dadffb32224f248df7a6ad70f1e6eecc7755dcca2724107b35845",
      "text": "是的。恕我冒昧还未自我介绍，我其实\n在一家偶像事务所担任制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebf7c9423a0ea1e38a1f5290a12427eb7852d9ed9a8d130f56b58b8debbd03a7",
      "text": "下次事务所会举办一场试镜，\n您愿意去参加试试吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7734af98331a9dc7f4239a2e2d6004b5c094ba926e395b790094ea1d69142fc2",
      "text": "当偶像……我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c76a252840894e7c6e2b2b4b225215512f6b5f48df7ae3cc3a5d44fca633bc58",
      "text": "唔——……你刚才，\n说要为我的梦想助一臂之力对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f260a8025cb35763a00227f0450e8d82d12434172b3d29a50c6953f5857785aa",
      "text": "那也就是说……只要去当偶像，\n我的梦想就能实现了，可以这么理解吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4c21b7c00743b001d85d2b0b499b2ff55a2122205732270be8f3646b45fd711",
      "text": "是的，就是这样！\n当然，本人的努力也很重要就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dd1c10ac36ecdcf094acd48ebc083244972c60a622b56a142cfd9a8989e1ee0",
      "text": "面向支持自己的粉丝们，\n全力以赴地唱歌、跳舞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1859ec297a3a17feeac44878011626cec84e2f8796c9cbbee8aad3a854b34dce",
      "text": "我相信只要看到那样的身姿，很多人\n都会绽放出笑容的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80ebf655925834102f5b741eacb5e8097f46d96a85b4b27d82d0a9449f37b71c",
      "text": "原来如此……好，我懂了！\n感觉挺有意思的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2cf1403e9926d5149f97d0bf6149dff19d6fd0dd3352d303cfa84e9595a6c64",
      "text": "我要和你一起当偶像！然后，\n让大家都展露笑容！还有，接下来是～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3207a7fb77ded1a49db40864e5f211e3e0b375a0de8106084712e23c6b7346eb",
      "text": "真的吗，非常感谢！\n那么，关于具体的日程安排……哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e047159adb4a8a05729c732e875602a5925fb295123b60e9792f56e1d23afd",
      "text": "那颗最先亮起的星……\n……呼。……呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcaceefe82a5202bcf3a9c106d33e4a17ae0aeef1f0ac6de83f2a73765061ff9",
      "text": "睡着了呢。那么，\n在名片上留个便条……我就先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
